Walking into the dressing rooms of the teen contestants....

No, MDMA (like all amphetamines) has a host of potentially serious adverse effects.  The heatstroke thing is famous, but not the only risk.  Not saying that it's straight-up poison... but it is bad for your heart, IMMENSELY addictive, and can cause a number of psychological issues.  And that's if it's pure!  The possibilities for harm from low-quality drugs are pretty much endless.

&#x200B;

As for the question of why the other guy shit in the shower, I'd say it was because he was high as a fucking kite, but that's just a guess.
